<title>JAPAN: Suzuken, Akiyama to hold news briefing on merger.</title>
<headline>Suzuken, Akiyama to hold news briefing on merger.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese prescription drug wholesaler Suzuken Co Ltd and pharmaceutical wholesaler Akiyama Inc said on Thursday that they will hold a news conference at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) to announce a merger.</p>
</text>
